Data Licences and Attribution
==============================

Sentinel-2 imagery
  Provider   : European Space Agency (ESA) / Copernicus Programme
  Product    : Sentinel-2 MSI Level-2A (S2-L2A)
  Licence    : Copernicus Sentinel Data Terms and Conditions
               https://sentinel.esa.int/documents/247904/690755/Sentinel_Data_Legal_Notice
  Access     : Microsoft Planetary Computer STAC API
               https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/dataset/sentinel-2-l2a

Planet Tanager hyperspectral imagery
  Provider   : Planet Labs PBC
  Product    : Tanager-1 Surface Reflectance
  Licence    : Planet Education & Research Programme terms
               https://www.planet.com/markets/education-and-research/
  Access     : Planet STAC API (open-archive access where available)
               https://www.planet.com/data/stac/

CGLS Lake Water Quality (LWQ) 100m product
  Provider   : Copernicus Global Land Service (CGLS)
  Product    : Lake Water Quality 100m V2.0 (2019–present)
  Licence    : Copernicus Land Monitoring Service data policy (free reuse with attribution)
               https://land.copernicus.eu/
  Parameters : Chlorophyll-a (µg/L), Turbidity (FNU), Trophic State Index, Cyanobacteria risk

JRC Global Surface Water (GSW)
  Provider   : European Commission Joint Research Centre
  Product    : JRC Global Surface Water Explorer (Landsat-based, 1984–present)
  Licence    : CC BY 4.0
               https://global-surface-water.appspot.com/

Reference scientific publications used for validation
  See docs/data_sources.md for full citation list.
